### WD-1912 — Order/getForzaTownships: catálogo departamento/municipio de Forza
# Lee directo de Forza (Foundation.ForzaService), sin caché. Sin `department` devuelve
# solo la lista de departamentos; con `department` (HeaderCode o nombre) ese
# departamento con sus municipios (HeaderCodeTownship = guide.shipping.townshipCode).

### Solo departamentos
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/getForzaTownships
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

### Un departamento (por nombre, sin importar acentos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/getForzaTownships
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "department": "Guatemala" }

### Un departamento (por HeaderCode)
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/getForzaTownships
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "department": "03" }

### Departamento inexistente → 400 VALIDATION_FAILURE (con la lista de departamentos en details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/getForzaTownships
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "department": "Narnia" }
